	(lib_symbols)
	(text "USART3 - DUT side channel debug (RX Only)\nUSART1 - Daughter board RP boot-over-uart\nUSART2 - DUT bi-directional UART\nI2C1 - i2c bus (lights, power monitor, daughter EEPROM)\nSDIO - daughter bulk storage transfer\nSPI2 - soft bus (SD, daughter peripherals, OLED)\nSPI4 - master NIC\nUSB HS - passthrough to DUT via daughter board\nUSB FS - master-only debug device port (uses EXTI8 for VBUS sensing)\n\nEXTI8 - USB FS 3V3 VBUS detect interrupt (requires divider)\n"
